#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:5
msgid ""
"The <strong>FixMyStreet name</strong> is a string that represents the name "
"of the web application as it is usually displayed to the user (e.g., amongst"
" a list of other applications, or as a label for an icon)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>FixMyStreet "
"name</strong>は、通常ユーザーに表示されるWebアプリケーションの名前を表す文字列です（例：他のアプリケーションの一覧の中や、アイコンのラベルなど）。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:10
msgid ""
"The <strong>FixMyStreet short name</strong> is a string that represents the "
"name of the web application displayed to the user if there is not enough "
"space to display name (e.g., as a label for an icon on the phone home "
"screen)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>FixMyStreet short "
"name</strong>は、名前を表示する十分なスペースがない場合にユーザーに表示されるWebアプリケーションの名前を表す文字列です（例：スマートフォンのホーム画面上のアイコンのラベルなど）。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:15
msgid ""
"The <strong>WasteWorks name</strong> is a string that represents the name of"
" the web application as it is usually displayed to the user (e.g., amongst a"
" list of other applications, or as a label for an icon)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>WasteWorks "
"name</strong>は、ユーザーに通常表示されるWebアプリケーションの名前を表す文字列です（例：他のアプリケーションのリスト内や、アイコンのラベルなど）。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:20
msgid ""
"The <strong>WasteWorks short name</strong> is a string that represents the "
"name of the web application displayed to the user if there is not enough "
"space to display name (e.g., as a label for an icon on the phone home "
"screen)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>WasteWorks short "
"name</strong>は、名前を表示する十分なスペースがない場合にユーザーに表示されるWebアプリケーションの名前を表す文字列です（例：スマートフォンのホーム画面上のアイコンのラベルなど）。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:30
msgid ""
"The <strong>background colour</strong> defines a placeholder background "
"colour for the application splash screen before it has loaded.  Colours "
"should be specified with CSS syntax, e.g. "
"<strong><code>#ff00ff</code></strong> or <strong><code>rgb(255, 0, "
"255)</code></strong> or a named colour like "
"<strong><code>fuchsia</code></strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>background "
"colour</strong>は、アプリケーションのスプラッシュ画面が読み込まれる前のプレースホルダー背景色を定義します。色はCSS構文で指定してください。例：<strong><code>#ff00ff</code></strong>、<strong><code>rgb(255,"
" 0, 255)</code></strong>、または<strong><code>fuchsia</code></strong>のような名前付きの色。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/bodies/open311-form-fields.html:14
#: templates/web/base/admin/bodies/open311-form-fields.html:15
msgid ""
"The <strong>endpoint</strong> is the URL of the service that FixMyStreet will connect to \n"
"            when sending reports to this body."
msgstr ""

#: templates/web/base/admin/manifesttheme/form.html:59
msgid ""
"The <strong>icons</strong> are used when the application is installed to the"
" user's home screen. Icons must be <strong>square</strong>, with "
"<strong>512x512</strong>px and <strong>192x192</strong>px being the most "
"common sizes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>icons</strong>は、アプリケーションがユーザーのホーム画面にインストールされた際に使用されます。アイコンは<strong>正方形</strong>である必要があり、最も一般的なサイズは<strong>512x512</strong>pxおよび<strong>192x192</strong>pxです。"

#: templates/web/base/admin/bodies/open311-form-fields.html:27
#: templates/web/base/admin/bodies/open311-form-fields.html:28
msgid ""
"The <strong>jurisdiction</strong> is only needed if the endpoint is serving more\n"
"          than one. If the body is running its own endpoint, you can usually leave this blank."
msgstr ""

#: templates/web/base/admin/bodies/contact-form.html:168
